      "id": "n1",
      "text": "more than 950 megawatts unavailable. Kepco SPC Power's Unit 2. Eleven generators. seasonal heat drove demand into a thin operating margin. Officials ordered emergency load shedding to keep a critical 230-kilovolt transmission line from overloading The event unfolds across a large-scale power deficit and power shortage.",
