    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "An unforeseen mechanical failure in a generating unit, compounded by ongoing maintenance issues and a heatwave impact, resulted in a large-scale power deficit for the island group. This energy deficit, part of a broader grid incident, highlighted the thin operating margin the system was running on. The power shortage underscored the vulnerability of the region's energy supply, leaving the affected generators and the grid operator to manage the capacity loss.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Innocent",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "why-1",
          "why-2",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "center": "result-0",
        "center_kind": "result",
        "channel": "toned",
        "channel_role": "element_centered",
        "composition_mode": "ADR-0008",
        "salience_rank": 0
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.65
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "A power unit experienced a sudden shutdown, becoming a failed component seeking repair. This affected power unit was central to a grid incident that unfolded in May 2026. Its trip offline was the initial step that cascaded into a red alert declaration and subsequent emergency response, directly contributing to the power outage and the loss of over 950 megawatts of capacity from the system.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Innocent",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "center": "who-1",
        "center_kind": "who",
        "channel": "toned",
        "channel_role": "element_centered",
        "composition_mode": "ADR-0008",
        "salience_rank": 1
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.6
    },
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "Following a sudden operational interruption with a key power unit, officials took steps to stabilize the grid. The trusted grid guardian issued a protective warning for the region, and duty-bound decision-makers ordered emergency measures to prevent system collapse. Their timely actions, while leading to load shedding, aimed to safeguard the affected community and restore balance to the energy infrastructure after a significant power shortfall was triggered by high demand and an unforeseen failure.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Innocent",
        "fragments": [
