          "how-1",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "search_text": "A power unit experienced a sudden shutdown, becoming a failed component seeking repair. This affected power unit was central to a grid incident that unfolded in May 2026. Its trip offline was the initial step that cascaded into a red alert declaration and subsequent emergency response, directly contributing to the power outage and the loss of over 950 megawatts of capacity from the system.",
        "persona_id": "The-Innocent",
        "center_element": "who-1",
        "supporting_elements": [
